<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Siparişin Kargoda</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            color: #ffffff;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
        }
        .truck-animation {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 100px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        .tracking-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 30px 0;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .tracking-number {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            color: #3b82f6;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .timeline {
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        .timeline-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px;
            border-left: 3px solid #e5e7eb;
            margin-left: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .timeline-item.active {
            border-left-color: #3b82f6;
        }
        .timeline-dot {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #e5e7eb;
            position: absolute;
            left: -9px;
        }
        .timeline-item.active .timeline-dot {
            background-color: #3b82f6;
        }
        .timeline-content {
            margin-left: 20px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #3b82f6 0%, #2563eb 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 15px 40px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #eff6ff;
            border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #999999;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>🚚 Siparişin Yolda!</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="truck-animation">🚛</div>
            
            <h2 style="text-align: center; color: #333333;">Merhaba {{name}}! 👋</h2>
            <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 18px; color: #666666;">
                Harika haber! Siparişin <strong>{{carrier}}</strong> ile kargoya verildi.
            </p>

            <!-- Tracking Box -->
            <div class="tracking-box">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px;">Kargo Takip Numarası</p>
                <div class="tracking-number">{{trackingNumber}}</div>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0;">Sipariş No: #{{orderNumber}}</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Info Box -->
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong style="color: #1e40af;">📅 Tahmini Teslimat:</strong>
                <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0; color: #666666;">
                    {{#if estimatedDelivery}}
                        {{estimatedDelivery}}
                    {{else}}
                        2-3 iş günü içinde
                    {{/if}}
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Timeline -->
            <div class="timeline">
                <h3 style="color: #333333; margin-bottom: 20px;">Kargo Durumu:</h3>
                
                <div class="timeline-item active">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <strong style="color: #3b82f6;">✓ Sipariş Alındı</strong>
                        <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Sipariş başarıyla oluşturuldu</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item active">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <strong style="color: #3b82f6;">✓ Hazırlandı</strong>
                        <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Ürünler paketlendi</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item active">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <strong style="color: #3b82f6;">✓ Kargoya Verildi</strong>
                        <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Kargo şirketine teslim edildi</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <strong style="color: #666666;">⏳ Dağıtımda</strong>
                        <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Kurye adresine yöneldi</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                    <div class="timeline-content">
                        <strong style="color: #666666;">📦 Teslim Edildi</strong>
                        <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 14px; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Kargo teslim alındı</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <p style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="{{trackingUrl}}" class="button">Kargoyu Takip Et</a>
            </p>

            <p style="color: #666666; text-align: center;">
                Kargo ile ilgili tüm güncellemeleri takip sayfasından anlık olarak görebilirsin.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Kargo ile ilgili sorun mu yaşıyorsun?</p>
            <p><a href="mailto:destek@myshop.com" style="color: #3b82f6;">destek@myshop.com</a></p>
            <p>© 2026 MyShop. Tüm hakları saklıdır.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>